// Every built-in module on a grid, with no cables, to check panel layouts
// side by side (panels.md, Panel layout). Render it with:
//   cargo run --release -p loom-app -- examples/dev/all-modules.ron --screenshot /tmp/all.png
// The modules are in help-page order, six to a row; Transport is top right.
Patch(
    version: 1,
    name: "All modules",
    modules: [
        PatchModule(id: 1, kind: "loom.clock.clock@1", position: Some((0.0, 0.0))),
        PatchModule(id: 2, kind: "loom.display.meter@1", position: Some((320.0, 0.0))),
        PatchModule(id: 3, kind: "loom.display.scope@1", position: Some((640.0, 0.0))),
